<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Hartford Financial upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Hartford Financial upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it restarted coverage of insurer Hartford Financial Services Group Inc and ungraded to to outperform from neutral on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 87 in early trading.</p>
</text>
